      factPt: 'O <span class="gloss" data-gloss="lapis-lazuli">lápis-lazúli</span> vinha de minas no atual Afeganistão, a milhares de quilômetros do Egito, e era reservado à realeza e aos deuses. Prometê-lo a Sinué era dizer: serás sepultado como um grande do Egito.',
      factEn: '<span class="gloss" data-gloss="lapis-lazuli">Lapis lazuli</span> came from mines in present-day Afghanistan, thousands of kilometers from Egypt, and was reserved for royalty and the gods. Promising it to Sinuhe meant: you shall be buried as one of the great of Egypt.'
